## Coherence (Design)

| Decision | Followed? | Notes |
|----------|-----------|-------|
| DeepSeek: OpenAIAdapter subclass with base_url override | ✅ Yes | DeepSeekAdapter inherits OpenAIAdapter, _base_url="https://api.deepseek.com/v1" |
| Gemini: google-generativeai SDK with standalone adapter | ✅ Yes | GeminiAdapter uses genai.GenerativeModel, async stream_chat, validate via generate_content_async |
| Kimi/Minimax: Remove immediately | ✅ Yes | No Kimi/Minimax adapters in codebase; schema rejects them |
| ProviderRegistry class over get_adapter() function | ✅ Yes | ProviderRegistry with register/get_adapter/list_providers; singleton instance in __init__.py |
| Per-adapter SUPPORTED_MODELS class attribute | ✅ Yes | Each adapter defines SUPPORTED_MODELS; list_providers reads via getattr |
| Adapter-level validate() method | ✅ Yes | Each adapter has validate(api_key) → bool; OpenAI: models.list, Anthropic: messages.create(max_tokens=1), Gemini: generate_content_async |
| Frontend Provider type expansion | ✅ Yes | credentialsStore.ts Provider type, ChatSettings.tsx PROVIDERS array, ChatPage.tsx PROVIDER_LABELS all reflect V1 set |

